# The scheme typed as a concept as well. SKOS S9.
# expect: violation "cannot also be a concept"

@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix concept: <https://andyfitzgeraldconsulting.com/ns/project-graph/concepts#> .
@prefix scheme: <https://andyfitzgeraldconsulting.com/ns/project-graph/> .

scheme:concepts a skos:Concept .
